WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.294
ELEANOR BISHOP
So Kate is helping you

00:00:02.344 --> 00:00:04.188
with an Avengers level threat?

00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:08.050
KATE BISHOP
He's my partner.

00:00:08.579 --> 00:00:09.493
CLINT BARTON
That's kind of a stretch.

00:00:15.342 --> 00:00:16.534
CLINT BARTON
You want to be a superhero?

00:00:16.584 --> 00:00:17.760
You put your life in danger.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.292
KATE BISHOP
There's also cool costumes

00:00:19.342 --> 00:00:20.312
and trick arrows.

00:00:20.576 --> 00:00:22.642
Some people have actually called
me the world's greatest archer.

00:00:22.693 --> 00:00:23.815
CLINT BARTON
Are you one of those people?

